#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-led-ProfiLED.rst:10
#: 8681772784c54c4ca2b4ab458f5374b7
msgid ""
"ProfiLEDs are spaced at 20mm resulting in 50 LED's per meter. ProfiLEDs are "
"supplyed in 2m strips with the servo header pre-attached, simply plug them "
"in. The strips can be cut at any point and extended or have a new header "
"added and plugged into a second pair of output pins. ProfiLED's require both"
" clock and data signal. As supplied the clock is the yellow wire and green "
"is data. Both the clock and data pins must be in the same PWM group. It is "
"possible to share a clock pin over multiple strips in the same group. If "
"there are spare pins it may be more convenient to setup two clock pins for "
"that group. ProfiLED's require 5 volts and can draw a significant amount of "
"current if all turned on at once. ProfiLED's default to white until a valid "
"signal is received."
msgstr ""
"ProfiLED以20mm间距排列，每米50颗LED。ProfiLED以2米灯带形式提供，预先连接好舵机插头，直接插上即可使用。灯带可在任意位置剪断，进行延长或添加新插头并插入第二组输出引脚。ProfiLED需要时钟和数据信号。默认提供的接线中，黄线为时钟，绿线为数据。时钟和数据引脚必须在同一PWM组中。可以在同一组的多个灯带上共享一个时钟引脚。如果有空余引脚，为该组设置两个时钟引脚可能更方便。ProfiLED需要5伏供电，全部亮起时可消耗大量电流。ProfiLED在接收到有效信号前默认为白色。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-serial-led-ProfiLED.rst:17
#: 6329344a399f42d4b22defd0f3283858
msgid ""
"Any servo output wired to the clock of the LED's should be set to "
"``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 132 for 'ProfiLED Clock'. The data input to the LED's "
"should be set to ``SERVOX_FUNCTION`` 129 - 'ProfiLED 1', 130 - 'ProfiLED 2' "
"or 131 - 'ProfiLED 3' for notify output or one of the scripting outputs "
"(``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 94 to 109) for use with Lua scripting. To enable "
"ProfiLED notify output the :ref:`NTF_LED_TYPES<NTF_LED_TYPES>` bitmask "
"should include ProfiLED, this is bit 9. :ref:`NTF_LED_LEN<NTF_LED_LEN>` "
"should be set to the length of the longest string that is connected. There "
"are several other NTF parameters that allow the brightness and colour "
"patterns to be changed. Several Lua scripting LED control examples can be "
"found in the ArduPilot `examples folder "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/examples>`__."
msgstr ""
"任何接到LED时钟的舵机输出应将 ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 设置为132（'ProfiLED Clock'）。LED的数据输入应将 "
"``SERVOX_FUNCTION`` 设置为129 - 'ProfiLED 1'、130 - 'ProfiLED 2'或131 - 'ProfiLED"
" 3'（用于通知输出）或脚本输出之一（ ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` "
"94至109）（用于Lua脚本）。要启用ProfiLED通知输出，:ref:`NTF_LED_TYPES<NTF_LED_TYPES>` "
"位掩码应包含ProfiLED，即第9位。:ref:`NTF_LED_LEN<NTF_LED_LEN>` "
"应设置为连接的最长灯带长度。还有其他几个NTF参数允许更改亮度和颜色模式。多个Lua脚本LED控制示例可在ArduPilot的 `示例文件夹 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/examples>`__"
" 中找到。"

